hree lead-ins, or get Taming the Beast directly from Thotar."}, [129]={hint="Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or get Taming the Beast directly from Thotar."}, [130]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or get Taming the Beast directly from Thotar."}, [131]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar"}, [132]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Dire Mottled Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar in Razor Hill."}, [133]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar"}, [134]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. The second target is a Surf Crawler."}, [135]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Surf Crawler. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar at Razor Hill.", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. The second target is a Surf Crawler."}, [136]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. The second target is a Surf Crawler."}, [137]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. Tame an Armored Scorpid third."}, [138]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Armored Scorpid. Practice your skills, then return to Thotar at Razor Hill.", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. Tame an Armored Scorpid third."}, [139]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Prerequisite: Taming the Beast. Tame an Armored Scorpid third."}, [140]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [141]={hint="Speak with Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar.", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [142]={npc="Ormak Grimshot", tgt="Ormak Grimshot", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [143]={npc="Ophek", tgt="Ophek", tag="Optional", desc="Skip the breadcrumb if desired. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [144]={hint="Speak with Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Skip the breadcrumb if desired. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [145]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Skip the breadcrumb if desired. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [146]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Get the tablet from the cave at Skull Rock, east of Orgrimmar."}, [147]={hint="Retrieve the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", desc="Get the tablet from the cave at Skull Rock, east of Orgrimmar."}, [148]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Get the tablet from the cave at Skull Rock, east of Orgrimmar."}, [149]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Use the glyph at the summoning circle by Neeru and defeat the Voidwalker, then turn in to Gan'rul."}, [150]={hint="Using the Glyphs of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Glyphs of Summoning to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", desc="Use the glyph at the summoning circle by Neeru and defeat the Voidwalker, then turn in to Gan'rul."}, [151]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Use the glyph at the summoning circle by Neeru and defeat the Voidwalker, then turn in to Gan'rul."}, [152]={npc="Tai'jin", tgt="Tai'jin"}, [153]={hint="Speak to Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar."}, [154]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo"}, [155]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo", desc="If Ur'kyo has no new quest after you turn in Hex of Weakness and you've already learned the spell, just skip this step."}, [156]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [157]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo"}, [158]={text="If you have Orgrimmar quests, follow the main road north through the south gate. Learn Doras's flight path (45.12, 63.89) and turn in nearby quests."}, [159]={npc="Nazgrel", tgt="Nazgrel", tag="Optional"}, [160]={hint="Bring an Example Collar to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional"}, [161]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade", tag="Optional"}, [162]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade", desc="Only available after the Example Collar turn-in; take it to Far Watch Post in the Barrens to turn in."}, [163]={hint="Speak with Thuwd in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.", tag="Optional"}, [164]={npc="Thuwd", tgt="Thuwd", tag="Optional"}, [165]={hint="Deliver Halikor's Hoof to Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional"}, [166]={npc="Kamari", tgt="Kamari", tag="Optional"}, [167]={npc="Therzok", tgt="Therzok", desc="Steal Tazan's Key first, then get his pack. Keep the key for the follow-up."}, [168]={npc="Uthel'nay", tgt="Uthel'nay", tag="Optional", desc="Ask Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar or Thurston Xane in Thunder Bluff. Un'Thuwa offers Ju-Ju Heaps."}, [169]={text="After the city turn-ins, hearth to Razor Hill or run south along the main road. Skip this trip if you stayed out of the city."}, [170]={npc="Swart", tgt="Swart", desc="Starts at Razor Hill. Kranal's follow-ups are shared with the Bloodhoof Village breadcrumb; see The Barrens: Crossroads. Complete only one set."}, [171]={hint="Speak with Un'thuwa.", tag="Optional", desc="If you're in Sen'jin Village, pick up Ju-Ju Heaps directly from Un'Thuwa."}, [172]={npc="Un'Thuwa", tgt="Un'Thuwa", tag="Optional", desc="If you're in Sen'jin Village, pick up Ju-Ju Heaps directly from Un'Thuwa."}, [173]={npc="Un'Thuwa", tgt="Un'Thuwa"}, [174]={hint="Destroy 4 Ju-Ju Heaps, then return to Un'thuwa in Sen'jin Village."}, [175]={npc="Un'Thuwa", tgt="Un'Thuwa"}, [177]={npc="Takrin Pathseeker", tgt="Takrin Pathseeker", desc="Requires level 10. Wait until around 12 to head to the Crossroads."}, [178]={hint="Follow the western road from Razor Hill to the Barrens over a bridge."}, [179]={npc="Ak'Zeloth", tgt="Ak'Zeloth"}, [180]={npc="Kargal Battlescar", tgt="Kargal Battlescar"}, [181]={npc="Kargal Battlescar", tgt="Kargal Battlescar"}, [182]={hint="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.", desc="Starts at Razor Hill. Kranal's follow-ups are shared with the Bloodhoof Village breadcrumb; see The Barrens: Crossroads. Complete only one set."}, [183]={npc="Kranal Fiss", tgt="Kranal Fiss", desc="Starts at Razor Hill. Kranal's follow-ups are shared with the Bloodhoof Village breadcrumb; see The Barrens: Crossroads. Complete only one set."}, [184]={text="Go west from Far Watch Post. Turn south at the T-junction for the Crossroads."}, [185]={hint="Follow the western road from Kargal's Far Watch Outpost."}, [186]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [187]={node="The Crossroads", desc="Learn Devrak's flight path. If convenient, set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind."}, [188]={text="From the Crossroads, follow the main road east to Ratchet and unlock the Ratchet flight path while you're there."}, [189]={hint="Kill Tazan and bring his Satchel to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.", desc="Steal Tazan's Key first, then get his pack. Keep the key for the follow-up."}, [190]={text="Fly from Ratchet to Orgrimmar and go back to the Cleft of Shadow to find Therzok."}, [191]={npc="Therzok", tgt="Therzok", desc="Steal Tazan's Key first, then get his pack. Keep the key for the follow-up."}, [192]={npc="Therzok", tgt="Therzok", desc="Keep the key and wait for Therzok to offer The Shattered Hand before opening the pack.", star={"Blade of Cunning", {"ROGUE"}}}, [193]={hint="Steal Tazan's key, then use it to open his Satchel and deliver its contents to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.", desc="Keep the key and wait for Therzok to offer The Shattered Hand before opening the pack."}, [194]={npc="Therzok", tgt="Therzok", desc="Keep the key and wait for Therzok to offer The Shattered Hand before opening the pack.", star={"Blade of Cunning", {"ROGUE"}}}}},
    ["01-3"] = {name="Camp Narache", tips={{k="交通", text="From other starting zones, head to Bloodhoof Village first, then follow the road south up Red Cloud Mesa to Camp Narache."}, {k="取捨", text="Do Rite of Strength, Break Sharptusk!, and The Battleboars on one Brambleblade Ravine loop. Accept Attack on Camp Narache if you loot the map."}, {k="提醒", text="Below level 6? Grind Battleboars or Bristleback quilboar along the edge of Brambleblade Ravine, then head to Bloodhoof Village.", s={{"Below level 6?"}, {"Grind Battleboars or Bristleback quilboar along the edge of Brambleblade Ravine, then head to Bloodhoof Village"}}}}, danger={[1]="Quilboar pack the narrow ramp in Brambleblade Ravine. Clear it before pulling Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle. Retreat toward Red Cloud Mesa."}, grind={[1]={mob="Plainstrider", note="Dense, mostly neutral normal mobs by Camp Narache's southeast well. Pull singles during The Hunt Begins."}, [2]={mob="Mountain Cougar", note="Dense, mostly neutral normal mobs on Red Cloud Mesa's south slope. Pull singles for the pelts needed in The Hunt Continues."}, [3]={mob="Bristleback Battleboar", note="Normal mobs cluster among Bristleback quilboar in Brambleblade Ravine. Clear the edges first. Pair with The Battleboars and Rite of Strength."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bronk Steelrage"}, [2]={npc="Moodan Sungrain"}, [3]={npc="Kawnie Softbreeze"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Camp Narache Gift Voucher", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Accept this only if you hold a Camp Narache Gift Voucher. The gift voucher is a starting item in the bags of characters of the original race. Right-click it directly; there is no pickup point on the map."}, [2]={hint="Bring the Camp Narache Gift Voucher to Vorn Skyseer.", tag="Optional", desc="Accept only if you have a Camp Narache Gift Voucher."}, [3]={npc="Vorn Skyseer", tgt="Vorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Accept only if you have a Camp Narache Gift Voucher."}, [4]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [5]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [6]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat."}, [7]={hint="Chief Hawkwind wants you to search for his mother near the water well to the southeast of Camp Narache."}, [8]={npc="Greatmother Hawkwind", tgt="Greatmother Hawkwind"}, [9]={npc="Greatmother Hawkwind", tgt="Greatmother Hawkwind"}, [10]={hint="Take a Water Pitcher from the water well.", desc="Get the Water Pitcher from the well next to Greatmother Hawkwind."}, [11]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [12]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [13]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [14]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [15]={hint="Read the Simple Note and speak to Harutt Thunderhorn in Camp Narache.", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [16]={npc="Harutt Thunderhorn", tgt="Harutt Thunderhorn", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [17]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [18]={hint="Read the Rune-Inscribed Note and speak to Meela Dawnstrider in Camp Narache.", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [19]={npc="Meela Dawnstrider", tgt="Meela Dawnstrider", desc="Finish The Hunt Begins, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [20]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [21]={hint="Read the Etched Note and speak to Lanka Farshot in Red Cloud Mesa."}, [22]={npc="Lanka Farshot", tgt="Lanka Farshot"}, [23]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [24]={hint="Read the Verdant Note and speak to Gart Mistrunner in Camp Narache."}, [25]={npc="Gart Mistrunner", tgt="Gart Mistrunner"}, [26]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [27]={npc="Brave Windfeather", tgt="Brave Windfeather"}, [28]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts."}, [29]={hint="Travel to Seer Graytongue who lives in the hills directly south of Camp Narache."}, [30]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue"}, [31]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue"}, [32]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue", desc="Bring the incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes of receiving it.", star={"Scorched Leather Pouch"}}, [33]={hint="Carry the Smoldering Incense to the shrine of An'she and Mu'sha in the southeastern hills before the incense burns to ash in ten minutes!", desc="Bring the incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes of receiving it."}, [34]={npc="Ritual Fire", npcObj=true, desc="Bring the incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes of receiving it.", star={"Scorched Leather Pouch"}}, [35]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [36]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [37]={hint="Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache."}, [38]={hint="Bring the head of Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle to Brave Windfeather in Red Cloud Mesa."}, [39]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks."}, [40]={npc="Dirt-stained Map", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Loot the Dirt-Stained Map from Bristleback quilboar and right-click it."}, [41]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [42]={npc="Brave Windfeather", tgt="Brave Windfeather"}, [43]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [44]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind", tag="Optional"}, [45]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [46]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [47]={npc="Antur Fallow", tgt="Antur Fallow", desc="Pick up from Antur Fallow on the west side of camp."}, [48]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather"}, [49]={hint="Bring 2 applications of Ritual Salve to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache."}, [50]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather"}, [51]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather", desc="Drink the Sapta to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth."}, [52]={hint="Find Kodo Rock and drink the Earth Sapta.", desc="Drink the Sapta to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth."}, [53]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Drink the Sapta to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth."}, [54]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Finish the quest to get your Earth Totem."}, [55]={hint="Bring the Rough Quartz to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache.", desc="Finish the quest to get your Earth Totem."}, [56]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather", desc="Finish the quest to get your Earth Totem."}, [57]={text="Leave Red Cloud Mesa and follow the road north to Bloodhoof Village."}}},
    ["01-4"] = {name="Mulgore: Bloodhoof Village", short="Bloodhoof Village", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do the three Rite of Vision quests, Rite of Wisdom and Journey into Thunder Bluff in one go; the last one conveniently unlocks the flight point."}, {k="取捨", text="Turn in each well quest before taking the next one. Tauren only. Skip the Wildmane Water Well chain if you're already level 12. Tauren only.", s={{"Turn in each well quest before taking the next one. Tauren only. Skip the Wildmane Water Well chain if you're already level 12. Tauren only.", {race={"Tauren"}}}}}, {k="取捨", text="Once at Thunder Bluff you can pick up the Ragefire Chasm prerequisites; take Testing an Enemy's Strength and Searching for the Lost Satchel from Rahauro only if you plan to run the dungeon."}, {k="提醒", text="If you're close to level 12 and still short on XP, prioritize the harpies north of Mulgore, the Red Rocks or Fizsprocket's mine.", s={{"If you're close to level 12 and still short on XP, prioritize the harpies north of Mulgore, the Red Rocks or Fizsprocket's mine"}}}}, danger={[1]="Patrols and miners can pull together inside the Venture Co. Mine. Clear the outside first, grab the clipboard, and leave the tunnel."}, grind={[1]={mob="Prairie Stalker", note="Scattered normal mobs north of Bloodhoof Village. Pull singles in the grass and watch for roamers. Pick up Mazzranache materials."}, [2]={mob="Venture Co. Supervisor", note="Normal mobs cluster around the Venture Co. Mine. Pull from outside and watch for workers and patrols. Pair with the mine quests."}, [3]={mob="Windfury Matriarch", note="Dense normal mobs at the harpy camp in northwest Mulgore. Pull along the edge to avoid casters. Grind here if close to level 12."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth"}, [2]={npc="Harant Ironbrace"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth"}, [4]={npc="Kennah Hawkseye"}, [5]={npc="Tal"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Deliver the Supply Bundle to Kaga Wildhoof near Bloodhoof Village."}, [2]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof"}, [3]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof"}, [4]={hint="Sit near Kaga's Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff."}, [5]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof"}, [6]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional"}, [7]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional", desc="Learn Skinning before accepting. Turn in once you meet the skill requirement."}, [8]={hint="Take the Totem of Hawkwind to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village. Follow the road out of Camp Narache."}, [9]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [10]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth", tgt="Innkeeper Kauth"}, [11]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof Village (45.93, 64.16).", bind="Bloodhoof Village"}, [12]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [13]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [14]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [15]={npc="Harken Windtotem", tgt="Harken Windtotem"}, [16]={npc="Maur Raincaller", tgt="Maur Raincaller"}, [17]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [18]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [19]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [20]={npc="Krang Stonehoof", tgt="Krang Stonehoof"}, [21]={hint="Defeat 3 other players in duels or Novice Warriors for Tang Stonehoof."}, [22]={npc="Krang Stonehoof", tgt="Krang Stonehoof"}, [23]={npc="Ahab Wheathoof", tgt="Ahab Wheathoof"}, [24]={hint="Speak with Pyall Silentstride in Bloodhoof Village to learn to become a cook.", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Pyall Silentstride", tgt="Pyall Silentstride", tag="Optional"}, [26]={hint="Speak with Yonn Deepcut in Bloodhoof Village to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Yonn Deepcut", tgt="Yonn Deepcut", tag="Optional"}, [28]={text="East of Bloodhoof Village → caravan and centaurs"}, [29]={hint="Collect 2 Well Stones and 2 Ambercorn and bring them back to Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village."}, [30]={hint="Bring 8 Trophy Swoop Quills to Harken Windtotem in Bloodhoof Village."}, [31]={hint="Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village."}, [32]={hint="Bring 6 Prairie Wolf Paws and 4 Plainstrider Talons to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof."}, [33]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [34]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [35]={hint="Use the Winterhoof Cleansing Totem at the Winterhoof Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn."}, [36]={hint="Find Longwalker Malah Longwind east of Bloodhoof Village, near the edge of Mulgore."}, [37]={npc="Malah Longwind", tgt="Malah Longwind"}, [38]={npc="Malah Longwind", tgt="Malah Longwind"}, [39]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [40]={hint="Morin Cloudstalker wants you to examine the contents of a supply crate at the Ravaged Caravan."}, [41]={npc="Sealed Supply Crate", npcObj=true}, [42]={npc="Sealed Supply Crate", npcObj=true}, [43]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [44]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [45]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [46]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [47]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [48]={hint="Bring Longwalker Malah's Report to Brave Wildrunner in Bloodhoof Village."}, [49]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [50]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [51]={hint="Bring Longwalker Malah's Report to Baine Bloodhoof."}, [52]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [53]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [54]={npc="Harken Windtotem", tgt="Harken Windtotem"}, [55]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [56]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [57]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [58]={npc="Ruul Eagletalon", tgt="Ruul Eagletalon"}, [59]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [60]={text="West: Palemane and the dig site. Follow the vision to the seer"}, [61]={hint="Kill 10 Palemane Tanners, 8 Palemane Skinners, and 5 Palemane Poachers, then return to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village."}, [62]={hint="Collect 5 Prospector's Picks."}, [63]={hint="Bring 8 Windfury Talons to Ruul Eagletalon in Bloodhoof Village."}, [64]={hint="Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears.", desc="Drink Water of the Seers by the campfire. Follow the vision NW; do quests en route."}, [65]={npc="Perith Stormhoof", tgt="Perith Stormhoof", tag="Optional", desc="To avoid an early city trip, escort now and turn in on your first Thunder Bluff visit."}, [66]={hint="Help Perith Stormhoof escape Palemane Rock, and report his safety to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [67]={npc="Seer Wiserunner", tgt="Seer Wiserunner"}, [68]={npc="Seer Wiserunner", tgt="Seer Wiserunner"}, [69]={hint="Bring 6 Stalker Claws and 6 Cougar Claws to Mull Thunderhorn."}, [70]={text="Hearth to Bloodhoof Village and turn in the western quests together."}, [71]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [72]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [73]={npc="Ruul Eagletalon", tgt="Ruul Eagletalon"}, [74]={npc="Maur Raincaller", tgt="Maur Raincaller"}, [75]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [76]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [77]={hint="Ahab Wheathoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore wants you to feed his prized puppy, Kyle the Frenzied.", desc="Bring a Tender Strider Meat and wait for Kyle to come close before feeding him."}, [78]={npc="Ahab Wheathoof", tgt="Ahab Wheathoof"}, [79]={text="Northern wells, red stones and the mine in the northeast"}, [80]={hint="Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull."}, [81]={hint="Travel to Red Rocks east of Thunder Bluff and speak with the Ancestral Spirit."}, [82]={npc="Lorekeeper Raintotem", tgt="Lorekeeper Raintotem"}, [83]={hint="Lorekeeper Raintotem wants you to kill 8 Bristleback Interlopers at Red Rocks."}, [84]={npc="Ancestral Spirit", tgt="Ancestral Spirit"}, [85]={npc="Ancestral Spirit", tgt="Ancestral Spirit"}, [86]={npc="Lorekeeper Raintotem", tgt="Lorekeeper Raintotem"}, [87]={hint="Kill 6 Galak Centaurs, 4 Galak Outrunners, and bring the head of Herak the Pillager to Baine Bloodhoof."}, [88]={hint="Kill 14 Venture Co. Workers and 6 Venture Co. Supervisors for Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."}, [89]={hint="Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."}, [90]={npc="Mulgore Expansion Plans", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Loot Mulgore Expansion Plans from Supervisor Fizsprocket to start the quest."}, [91]={hint="Collect the rest of Supervisor Fizsprocket's pages inside The Venture Co. Mine and bring them to Morin Cloudstalker near Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Collect all three notes inside the Venture Co. Mine before leaving."}, [92]={hint="Defeat Chakuyak and bring back her pelt."}, [93]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [94]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [95]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Optional"}, [96]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Group, Optional", desc="Below level 12? Do more quests near the mine."}, [97]={hint="Bring the Clearcutter Key to Morin Cloudstalker outside Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Group, Optional", desc="Below level 12? Do more quests near the mine."}, [98]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Group, Optional", desc="Below level 12? Do more quests near the mine."}, [99]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [100]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [101]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [102]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [103]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [104]={hint="Bring 8 Prairie Alpha Teeth to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village."}, [105]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [106]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [107]={hint="Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn.", tag="Optional"}, [108]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [109]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [110]={npc="Skorn Whitecloud", tgt="Skorn Whitecloud"}, [111]={hint="Bring 4 Flatland Prowler Claws to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff."}, [112]={text="Unlock Thunder Bluff and continue to the Crossroads"}, [113]={npc="Narm Skychaser", tgt="Narm Skychaser", desc="Starts at Bloodhoof Village. The follow-up Call of Fire continues at the Crossroads as a shaman class quest, or you can pick it up directly from Kranal."}, [114]={npc="Kary Thunderhorn", tgt="Kary Thunderhorn", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [115]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [116]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [117]={npc="Sian'dur", tgt="Sian'dur", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [118]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [119]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [120]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [121]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [122]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [123]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [124]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Adult Plainstrider. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [125]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [126]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [127]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Prairie Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [128]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [129]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [130]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Swoop. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [131]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [132]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [133]={hint="Speak with Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [134]={npc="Holt Thunderhorn", tgt="Holt Thunderhorn", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [135]={npc="Gennia Runetotem", tgt="Gennia Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [136]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [137]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [138]={npc="Innkeeper Pala", tgt="Innkeeper Pala", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [139]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [140]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [141]={npc="Innkeeper Gryshka", tgt="Innkeeper Gryshka", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [142]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [143]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [144]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [145]={hint="Use the spell \"Teleport: Moonglade\" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [146]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [147]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [148]={hint="Seek out the Great Bear Spirit in northwestern Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear. When finished, return to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, Moonglade.", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [149]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [150]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [151]={text="At Nighthaven, find Bunthen Plainswind (druids only; 44.28, 45.87) and fly to Thunder Bluff. If your hearth is set somewhere useful and off cooldown, you can hearth back instead. Skip the regular flight master Faustron south of Moonglade; that route isn't open yet."}, [152]={hint="Return to Thunder Bluff and speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise."}, [153]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [154]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [155]={text="Follow the central Mulgore road to Thunder Bluff and take the lift up into the city."}, [156]={node="Thunder Bluff", desc="Unlock the flight path with Tal."}, [157]={hint="Seek audience with High Chieftain Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff."}, [158]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof"}, [159]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof"}, [160]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof", tag="Optional"}, [161]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro", tag="Group, Optional"}, [162]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro", tag="Group, Optional"}, [163]={hint="Bring Thunderhorn's Report to Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [164]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tag="Optional"}, [165]={npc="Melor Stonehoof", tgt="Melor Stonehoof"}, [166]={npc="Eylah Sunhorn", tgt="Eylah Sunhorn", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [167]={hint="Purchase a Bundle of Herbs from Nida the herbalist, a Bundle of Cedar Twigs from Nata the enchanting supplier, and Sinew Thread from Mahu the leatherworking supplier and Ceremonial Flint and Tinder from Naal the cooking supplier.", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [168]={npc="Eylah Sunhorn", tgt="Eylah Sunhorn", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [169]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Learn Skinning first, then turn in 12 Light Leather."}, [170]={hint="Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Requires Skinning. Hand in 12 Light Leather. Hand in the materials at Thunder Bluff. Light Leather comes from skinning low-level beasts, or you can get it through trade."}, [171]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Learn Skinning first, then turn in 12 Light Leather."}, [172]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Meet the Leatherworking requirement. Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread."}, [173]={text="Coarse Thread", npc="Mahu", tag="Optional"}, [174]={hint="Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Requires Leatherworking and the quest's skill requirement. Also bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread. Hand in the materials at Thunder Bluff. Light Leather comes from skinning or trade. Buy Coarse Thread from a vendor."}, [175]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Meet the Leatherworking requirement. Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread. This quest is also offered by Boramu (44.08, 44.89)."}, [176]={text="At level 12, walk from Mulgore's east gate to Camp Taurajo in the Barrens."}, [177]={node="Camp Taurajo", desc="Unlock the flight path with Omusa Thunderhorn, then follow the main road north to the Crossroads."}, [178]={hint="Use the Cenarion Lunardust on the Moonkin Stone between Mulgore and the Barrens to bring forth Lunaclaw. From there, you must face Lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses."}, [179]={text="The Moonkin Stone is right at the mouth of the mountain path west of Camp Taurajo; after defeating Lunaclaw, fly from Camp Taurajo to Thunder Bluff."}, [180]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [181]={text="Fly from Thunder Bluff back to Camp Taurajo."}, [182]={npc="Kirge Sternhorn", tgt="Kirge Sternhorn", desc="Pick up when passing Camp Taurajo. Head to the Crossroads."}, [183]={hint="Speak with Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.", desc="Pick up when passing Camp Taurajo. Head to the Crossroads."}, [184]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork", desc="Pick up when passing Camp Taurajo. Head to the Crossroads."}, [185]={node="The Crossroads", desc="Follow the main road north to the Crossroads, then learn Devrak's flight path."}, [186]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind in the Crossroads inn (51.99, 29.89).", bind="The Crossroads"}, [187]={hint="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.", desc="Starts at Bloodhoof Village. The follow-up Call of Fire continues at the Crossroads as a shaman class quest, or you can pick it up directly from Kranal."}, [188]={npc="Kranal Fiss", tgt="Kranal Fiss", desc="Starts at Bloodhoof Village. The follow-up Call of Fire continues at the Crossroads as a shaman class quest, or you can pick it up directly from Kranal."}}},
    ["01-5"] = {name="Deathknell", tips={{k="交通", text="From other starting zones, get off the zeppelin at the tower south of Brill and follow the road west into Deathknell."}, {k="提醒", text="Start with Rude Awakening inside the crypt (Undead only). Pick up The Mindless Ones from Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20). If he has no quest, follow the road to Brill.", s={{"Start with Rude Awakening inside the crypt (Undead only)", {race={"Scourge"}}}, {"Pick up The Mindless Ones from Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20)"}, {"If he has no quest, follow the road to Brill"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Grind Rattlecage Skeletons to level 3, then accept Marla's Last Wish. Head to Brill at level 6 or once you finish this section.", s={{"Grind Rattlecage Skeletons to level 3, then accept Marla's Last Wish"}, {"Head to Brill at level 6 or once you finish this section"}}}}, danger={[1]="The narrow tunnel in Night Web's Hollow can pull spider packs from both sides. Clear the entrance before going in."}, grind={[1]={mob="Wretched Zombie", note="Dense, mostly neutral normal mobs north of Deathknell. Pull singles during The Mindless Ones at levels 1-2."}, [2]={mob="Night Web Spider", note="Dense normal mobs inside Night Web's Hollow. Clear in stages from the entrance to avoid extra pulls. Pair with the cave quests."}, [3]={mob="Scarlet Initiate", note="Dense normal mobs at the eastern Scarlet camp. Clear along the edge to avoid pulling zealots. Pair with the armband quest."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Blacksmith Rand"}, [2]={npc="Joshua Kien"}, [3]={npc="Joshua Kien"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Undertaker Mordo", tgt="Undertaker Mordo"}, [2]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [3]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [4]={hint="Shadow Priest Sarvis wants you to kill 8 Mindless Zombies and 8 Wretched Zombies."}, [5]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [6]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [7]={hint="Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings."}, [8]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [9]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [10]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [11]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [12]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [13]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [14]={hint="Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done."}, [15]={hint="Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain."}, [16]={hint="Executor Arren wants you to kill 10 Young Night Web Spiders and 8 Night Web Spiders."}, [17]={hint="Free 6 Webbed Victims in Night's Web Hollow for Aramis Hammerhand in Deathknell."}, [18]={hint="Bring Samuel Fipps' Remains to Marla's Grave, then return to Novice Elreth."}, [19]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [20]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [21]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [22]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [23]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [24]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [25]={hint="Bring Executor Arren 12 Scarlet Armbands from Scarlet Converts and Scarlet Initiates."}, [26]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [27]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [28]={hint="Kill Meven Korgal, the messenger, at the Crusader camp, then return any information you find to Executor Arren."}, [29]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [30]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [31]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones in Deathknell first, then accept this quest. You can also get the same quest from Novice Elreth (30.86, 66.05)."}, [32]={hint="Read the Consecrated Scroll and speak to Aramis Hammerhand in the church in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones in Deathknell first, then accept this quest."}, [33]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones in Deathknell first, then accept this quest."}, [34]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [35]={hint="Heal 5 Injured Deathguard with your Holy Light ability.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [36]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [37]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [38]={hint="Find the Frightened Paladin in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [39]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [40]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Accept before leaving Deathknell; turn in at Brill."}, [41]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [42]={hint="Read the Simple Scroll and speak to Dannal Stern in Deathknell.", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [43]={npc="Dannal Stern", tgt="Dannal Stern", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [44]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [45]={hint="Read the Encrypted Scroll and speak to David Trias in Deathknell.", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [46]={npc="David Trias", tgt="David Trias", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [47]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [48]={hint="Read the Tainted Scroll and speak to Maximillion in Deathknell."}, [49]={npc="Maximillion", tgt="Maximillion"}, [50]={npc="Venya Marthand", tgt="Venya Marthand", desc="Deathknell route. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [51]={hint="Bring Venya Marthand 3 Rattlecage Skulls.", desc="Deathknell route. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [52]={npc="Venya Marthand", tgt="Venya Marthand", desc="Deathknell route. Horde Warlocks can accept this quest."}, [53]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first to receive the scroll."}, [54]={hint="Read the Hallowed Scroll and speak to Dark Cleric Duesten in the church in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first to receive the scroll."}, [55]={npc="Dark Cleric Duesten", tgt="Dark Cleric Duesten", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first to receive the scroll."}, [56]={npc="Dark Cleric Duesten", tgt="Dark Cleric Duesten"}, [57]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl"}, [58]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first."}, [59]={hint="Read the Glyphic Scroll and speak to Isabella in the church in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first."}, [60]={npc="Isabella", tgt="Isabella", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first."}, [61]={text="Take the east road out of Deathknell to Brill."}}},
    ["01-6"] = {name="Tirisfal Glades: Brill", tips={{k="提醒", text="If you haven't accepted Vital Intelligence, start at the Brill inn and pick up the first batch of quests.", s={{"If you haven't accepted Vital Intelligence, start at the Brill inn and pick up the first batch of quests"}}}, {k="取捨", text="Do the Scarlet, spider, and Tomb Weed objectives on the southeast loop. Pair the north-shore murlocs with the Agamand quests. Turn in nearby quests and leave for the Crossroads at level 12."}, {k="取捨", text="Buy Coarse Thread from a vendor for The Chill of Death by the inn. If you still need north-shore murloc hides for Hides for the Forsaken, finish it on your next trip to the shore."}, {k="取捨", text="Finish both local Argent Dawn quests to unlock Bandarion Keep (Orcs, Trolls, and Undead only). Some follow-ups are Undead only. If you're heading straight to the Crossroads, leave after the two local quests.", s={{"Finish both local Argent Dawn quests to unlock Bandarion Keep (Orcs, Trolls, and Undead only)", {race={"Orc", "Troll", "Scourge"}}}, {"Some follow-ups are Undead only", {race={"Scourge"}}}, {"If you're heading straight to the Crossroads, leave after the two local quests"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Below level 12? Do At War With The Scarlet Crusade, The Family Crypt, or the Argent Dawn quests The Argent Emissary, The Cult of the Damned, and Remnants of War, depending on availability and where you are.", s={{"Below level 12?"}, {"Do At War With The Scarlet Crusade, The Family Crypt, or the Argent Dawn quests The Argent Emissary, The Cult of the Damned, and Remnants of War, depending on availability and where you are"}}}}, danger={[1]="Watch for zombies and roaming spirits in the southeast graveyard. Clear along the edge so you don't get boxed in."}, grind={[1]={mob="Scarlet Missionary", note="Scattered normal casters southwest of Brill. Pull singles from the edge during the first Scarlet Crusade quests."}, [2]={mob="Wandering Spirit", note="Normal mobs cluster with Blood Zombies in the southeast graveyard. Watch for patrols. Pair Rear Guard Patrol with the Tomb Weed quest."}, [3]={mob="Dark Neophyte", note="Dense normal mobs near the Argent Dawn quests to the southeast. Pull singles from the camp edge to avoid Dark Enforcers. Grind from 11 to 12."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Innkeeper Renee"}, [2]={npc="Abe Winters"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Renee"}, [4]={npc="Mrs. Winters"}, [5]={npc="Doras"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Deathguard Simmer", tgt="Deathguard Simmer"}, [2]={npc="Gordo", tgt="Gordo"}, [3]={hint="Steal 10 pumpkins from the farm to the west, just north of Deathknell and take them to Apothecary Johaan in Brill."}, [4]={hint="Collect 3 Gloom Weed and deliver them to Junior Apothecary Holland in the Brill graveyard."}, [5]={npc="Executor Zygand", tgt="Executor Zygand"}, [6]={npc="Executor Zygand", tgt="Executor Zygand"}, [7]={npc="Executor Zygand", tgt="Executor Zygand"}, [8]={npc="Executor Zygand", tgt="Executor Zygand"}, [9]={npc="Apothecary Johaan", tgt="Apothecary Johaan"}, [10]={npc="Junior Apothecary Holland", tgt="Junior Apothecary Holland"}, [11]={hint="Follow the road east out of Deathknell to find the town of Brill. Report to Shari Stilwell to continue your training."}, [12]={npc="Shari Stilwell", tgt="Shari Stilwell"}, [13]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [14]={hint="Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill.", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [15]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [16]={npc="Junior Apothecary Holland", tgt="Junior Apothecary Holland"}, [17]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Renee in Brill (61.72, 52.05).", bind="Brill"}, [18]={npc="Apothecary Johaan", tgt="Apothecary Johaan"}, [19]={npc=