nd and Coriella Calmbreeze in Shen'dar Village."}, [79]={npc="Constable Aonda", tgt="Constable Aonda"}, [80]={npc="Illaya Amberwind", tgt="Illaya Amberwind"}, [81]={hint="Listen to what Illaya Amberwind has to say."}, [82]={npc="Illaya Amberwind", tgt="Illaya Amberwind"}, [83]={npc="Illaya Amberwind", tgt="Illaya Amberwind", star={"Idol of Shifting Tides", {"DRUID"}}}, [84]={npc="Indari Sunseam", tgt="Indari Sunseam", star={"Simple Leather Satchel"}}, [85]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Zerril Softbreeze"}, [86]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [87]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [88]={npc="Constable Aonda", tgt="Constable Aonda"}, [89]={npc="Taleen Shimmerthread", tgt="Taleen Shimmerthread"}, [90]={hint="Collect 10 Prideclaw Pelts from the Prideclaws in Shen'dar Highlands."}, [91]={hint="Collect 3 Small Eggs and 8 Strider Meat from creatures found throughout the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [92]={hint="Slay 6 High Order Apprentices in Shen'dar Highlands."}, [93]={hint="Slay 8 Hippogryph Youths, 6 Hippogryph Protectors and a Hippogryph Matriarch in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [94]={hint="Kill 10 Highlands Bandits and their leader, \"Badwind\" Bennic in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [95]={hint="Collect 10 Pilfered Windstones from the Highlands Bandits in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [96]={hint="Collect 8 Hippogryph Down feathers in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [97]={npc="Indari Sunseam", tgt="Indari Sunseam", star={"Simple Leather Satchel"}}, [98]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Zerril Softbreeze"}, [99]={npc="Illaya Amberwind", tgt="Illaya Amberwind", star={"Idol of Shifting Tides", {"DRUID"}}}, [100]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [101]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [102]={npc="Constable Aonda", tgt="Constable Aonda"}, [103]={npc="Taleen Shimmerthread", tgt="Taleen Shimmerthread"}, [104]={npc="Bounty Available: Vulgara the Insatiable!", npcObj=true, tag="Group, Optional", desc="Elite. Skip if you can't solo it."}, [105]={hint="